00:00:56.835 --> 00:00:59.760
Your podcast is called "Conan
O'Brien Needs A Friend"

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.190
and Jack just has so many friends.

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:03.023
You know, what's interesting?

00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:05.970
You are, I think that's where
all this rage, on my part,

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:09.300
