00:01:15.759 --> 00:01:16.860
And you are just this-

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.120
Yeah.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:18.953
This, you know,

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:20.376
you're this grinning-

